  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-blockquote-element\r\n\r\n> If the cite attribute is present, it must be a valid URL potentially surrounded by spaces\\. \r\n\r\nHaving surrounding spaces within any attribute value should be discouraged to the point of banishment. It has a bad effect on internationalisation, particularly when converting from LTR to RTL or vice-versa.",
